OL,3,GNEWSATiny details and big ambitions for
OL,4,Arailway model of town's past
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of model railway enthusiasts
OL,7,Fhope a detailed recreation of a town's
OL,8,Fpast can one day become a permanent
OL,9,Fattraction.
OL,11,FThe seven-metre-long (23ft) layout
OL,12,Fdepicts Leominster's railway station
OL,13,Fand the surrounding area as it appeared
OL,14,Fduring the first half of the 20th
OL,15,FCentury.
OL,17,FIts creators say one of the most
OL,18,Frewarding moments came when a visitor
OL,19,Frecognised part of the scene from their
OL,20,Fown childhood.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
