OL,3,GNEWSATiny details and big ambitions for
OL,4,Arailway model of town's past
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We even met a lady who'd grown up in
OL,7,Fone of the houses that was on the goods
OL,8,Fyard area, so it was lovely to talk
OL,9,Fwith her and get a little bit of
OL,10,Fbackground information," said Peter
OL,11,FDennis, from the Marches Model Railway
OL,12,FGroup.
